{"id":"b0eb5443b164e777","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/04_propositional_modal.md","title":"命题、模态、直觉主义与代数语义","display":"命题、模态、直觉主义与代数语义","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","specification"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>specification</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"1.-五种语言不能混用\">1. 五种语言不能混用</h2>\n<p>C 用 p、neg、imp；M 再有 bot、box；I 用 p、imp、bot、and、or，否定只是到 bot 的蕴含；P 从 I 去掉 bot；H 在 I 基础上加原始 top。另一个 L 为三值语义使用 p、neg、imp、bot。它们各有独立 Fm、Forms、FormSet、Subst 谓词。集合公式的参数不是对象语言的命题变元；对象原子始终是带自然数名字的代码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2.-经典与模态\">2. 经典与模态</h2>\n<p>C1 为 A→(B→A)，C2 为 (A→(B→C))→((A→B)→(A→C))，C3 为 (¬A→¬B)→(B→A)。这些只是显示用记号；完整代码实例化在 CAx/MAx 的有限公式里给出。模态加入 ¬bot、K，以及 Flags 指定的 T、D、B、4、5、L。</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缩写</th>\n<th>集合参数（按位置）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"eabdafb75566a144\" href=\"?note=eabdafb75566a144\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CAx\">CAx</a></td>\n<td><code>t</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab3ffad7f96cd03d\" href=\"?note=ab3ffad7f96cd03d\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CProof\">CProof</a></td>\n<td><code>g, z261, a</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d1f0523155d31ff5\" href=\"?note=d1f0523155d31ff5\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CTable\">CTable</a></td>\n<td><code>v, s</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4fee39837eb328bf\" href=\"?note=4fee39837eb328bf\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CSat\">CSat</a></td>\n<td><code>v, a</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1836e64b312f3ba2\" href=\"?note=1836e64b312f3ba2\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CConseq\">CConseq</a></td>\n<td><code>g, a</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6f226bfb5fcb432c\" href=\"?note=6f226bfb5fcb432c\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MAx\">MAx</a></td>\n<td><code>e, t</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6f91db0be3167533\" href=\"?note=6f91db0be3167533\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MProof\">MProof</a></td>\n<td><code>e, g, z366, a</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6c535786457e5cab\" href=\"?note=6c535786457e5cab\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MFrame\">MFrame</a></td>\n<td><code>e, w, r</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"dfc399e1f596d128\" href=\"?note=dfc399e1f596d128\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MTable\">MTable</a></td>\n<td><code>w, r, v, s</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4e4fcc9b2d511fa9\" href=\"?note=4e4fcc9b2d511fa9\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MSat\">MSat</a></td>\n<td><code>e, w, r, v, x, a</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"f9a14cb1ffb0e555\" href=\"?note=f9a14cb1ffb0e555\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MConseq\">MConseq</a></td>\n<td><code>e, g, a</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"3695560d61c84d4f\" href=\"?note=3695560d61c84d4f\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_ConverseWF\">ConverseWF</a></td>\n<td><code>w, r</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>T 对应反身，D 对应串行，B 对应对称，4 对应传递，5 对应右欧几里得。L 的框架要求传递且每个非空子集有一个在该子集内没有后继的点。对称不自动加反身；521/526 是源稿指定的单独 B 版本。517 固定 T 与 5。</p>\n<p>L 的可靠性书面检查：若 w 强迫 □(□A→A) 但不强迫 □A，在 w 的可达非 A 世界集合中选无后继的 x。传递性保证 x 的所有后继仍可从 w 到达；极大性保证这些后继强迫 A，故 x 强迫 □A。而 w 的假设又使 x 强迫 □A→A，矛盾。这里用的是无后继方向，不能替换为无前驱方向。此论证不是任意无限前提的强完备性证明。</p>\n<h2 id=\"3.-直觉主义与中间逻辑\">3. 直觉主义与中间逻辑</h2>\n<p>八个正直觉主义模式在各 Ax 公式中逐个编码，规则仅 MP。Minimal 没有 ex falso，允许向上闭的常假强迫集 B。IPC 令 B 为空并有 ex falso。Positive 没有 bot。KC/WEM 加 ¬A∨¬¬A，要求主上锥有向；LC 加 (A→B)∨(B→A)，要求主上锥线性。全部强迫表使用后继蕴含子句；原子解释向上闭。</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缩写</th>\n<th>集合参数（按位置）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"4c582a9ffc3e163a\" href=\"?note=4c582a9ffc3e163a\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MinimalAx\">MinimalAx</a></td>\n<td><code>t</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"8468e35888ce9a70\" href=\"?note=8468e35888ce9a70\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MinimalTable\">MinimalTable</a></td>\n<td><code>w, r, v, b, s</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"7a9a6ec6fb6ca2f8\" href=\"?note=7a9a6ec6fb6ca2f8\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_IPCModel\">IPCModel</a></td>\n<td><code>w, r, v, b</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"34c30af8e91150ad\" href=\"?note=34c30af8e91150ad\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_IPCTable\">IPCTable</a></td>\n<td><code>w, r, v, b, s</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"4083d8c486ceea1a\" href=\"?note=4083d8c486ceea1a\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PositiveTable\">PositiveTable</a></td>\n<td><code>w, r, v, b, s</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"a3ba1aacd08ebfaa\" href=\"?note=a3ba1aacd08ebfaa\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_KCAx\">KCAx</a></td>\n<td><code>t</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"4911f5764eb9236a\" href=\"?note=4911f5764eb9236a\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_KCModel\">KCModel</a></td>\n<td><code>w, r, v, b</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"3a58c41644729e72\" href=\"?note=3a58c41644729e72\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LCAx\">LCAx</a></td>\n<td><code>t</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-21\" data-note=\"e9170a8afc11bfb4\" href=\"?note=e9170a8afc11bfb4\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_LCModel\">LCModel</a></td>\n<td><code>w, r, v, b</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>KC：若某后继强迫 A，则有向性使每个后继都有更后继强迫 A，从而当前强迫 ¬¬A；否则强迫 ¬A。LC：两个蕴含都失败将给出可比的相反见证，违背单调性。这些为定义层可靠性核对，不是完备性的形式化推导。</p>\n<h2 id=\"4.-Heyting-代数\">4. Heyting 代数</h2>\n<p>443 不合并为 IPC。其 D、偏序 R、meet/join/imp 三张二元函数图、底 z 与顶 o 都是集合参数。格条件采用最大下界/最小上界的充要条件，蕴含以残余 m(a,b)≤c ↔ a≤h(b,c) 固定方向。HValue 用有限后序求值表解释原始 top；HSat 指定顶为真。HConseq 对合法集合代数全称量化，未宣称存在所有代数的集合。</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缩写</th>\n<th>集合参数（按位置）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-22\" data-note=\"23fc3019079f617c\" href=\"?note=23fc3019079f617c\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HeytingAlgebra\">HeytingAlgebra</a></td>\n<td><code>D, R, m, j, h, z, o</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-23\" data-note=\"2183acadc6112b0b\" href=\"?note=2183acadc6112b0b\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HValue\">HValue</a></td>\n<td><code>D, R, m, j, h, z, o, v, a, b</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-24\" data-note=\"06ea58c3b2d480a5\" href=\"?note=06ea58c3b2d480a5\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HSat\">HSat</a></td>\n<td><code>D, R, m, j, h, z, o, v, a</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-25\" data-note=\"4dc3650ade643e92\" href=\"?note=4dc3650ade643e92\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HConseq\">HConseq</a></td>\n<td><code>g, a</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>与 IPC 的代数完备性属于另一个需证明的命题，不能靠重命名 HConseq 成 IPCProv 来消去。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-五种语言不能混用","text":"1. 五种语言不能混用","level":2},{"id":"2.-经典与模态","text":"2. 经典与模态","level":2},{"id":"3.-直觉主义与中间逻辑","text":"3. 直觉主义与中间逻辑","level":2},{"id":"4.-Heyting-代数","text":"4. Heyting 代数","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CAx","status":"resolved","id":"eabdafb75566a144","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 经典与模态","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CAx|CAx]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CProof","status":"resolved","id":"ab3ffad7f96cd03d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 经典与模态","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CProof|CProof]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CTable","status":"resolved","id":"d1f0523155d31ff5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 经典与模态","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CTable|CTable]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CSat","status":"resolved","id":"4fee39837eb328bf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 经典与模态","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CSat|CSat]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CConseq","status":"resolved","id":"1836e64b312f3ba2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 经典与模态","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CConseq|CConseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MAx","status":"resolved","id":"6f226bfb5fcb432c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 经典与模态","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MAx|MAx]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MProof","status":"resolved","id":"6f91db0be3167533","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 经典与模态","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MProof|MProof]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MFrame","status":"resolved","id":"6c535786457e5cab","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 经典与模态","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MFrame|MFrame]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MTable","status":"resolved","id":"dfc399e1f596d128","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 经典与模态","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MTable|MTable]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MSat","status":"resolved","id":"4e4fcc9b2d511fa9","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 经典与模态","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MSat|MSat]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MConseq","status":"resolved","id":"f9a14cb1ffb0e555","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 经典与模态","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_MConseq|MConseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_ConverseWF","status":"resolved","id":"3695560d61c84d4f","anchor"